[agent:result] ===EXPERIMENTS===
[agent:result] Experiments are the primary unit of organization in MLflow; all MLflow runs
[agent:result]   belong to an experiment. Each experiment lets you visualize, search, and
[agent:result]   compare runs, as well as download run artifacts or metadata for analysis in
[agent:result]   other tools. Experiments are maintained in a Databricks hosted MLflow tracking
[agent:result]   server.
[agent:result] 
[agent:result]   Experiments are located in the workspace file tree. You manage experiments
[agent:result]   using the same tools you use to manage other workspace objects such as
[agent:result]   folders, notebooks, and libraries.
[agent:result] 
